<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GROPROP SHAREHOLDERS CAUTIONED.</title>
<headline>GROPROP SHAREHOLDERS CAUTIONED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grove Property Fund Managers Ltd said on Friday that it was still in talks and that unitholders should continue to exercise caution in the trading of units until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
